Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:58.44,Shot,,0,0,0,,{\pos(12,10)}S45  "And the song you're hearing, brother"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.44,0:03:03.07,Shot,,0,0,0,,{\pos(12,10)}S46  "Wasn't sung by any throat"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.07,0:03:05.53,Shot,,0,0,0,,{\pos(12,10)}S47  "It was hummed out in a field somewhere"
